# Keep build contexts small and host-platform artifacts out of any image.
# The sync-engine service image and the CI image both build from repo root or
# a subdir; neither wants these.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/target
**/.git
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
.claude/worktrees
